    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31329" root="غبث" body-key="g">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَبَثَ</span></b> , (S, O,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَبَثَ</span></b> , (TK,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَبْثٌ</span>, (S,
O, K,) <i>He moistened, and beat up,</i> or <i>mingled,</i>
[the preparation of curd called] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَقِط</span> <i>with clarified
butter.</i> (Fr, S, O, K.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَبَثَ</span>, of which
it is a dial. var.; and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَبَثَتِ المَرْأَةُ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَبَثَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الأَقِطَ</span>.]

